[{"title":"林九娘墓三首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"一抔香落陌头馨，三协春风宿草经。\n贞冢无心催恨色，年来空作断肠青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林九娘墓三首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"古来烈女死犹生，不爱身前重后名。\n纵使贞魂甘寂寂，谁能凄断付孤茔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"速杨承之诸子过坐","author":"郭之奇","text":"连宵苦雨住柴扉，湿尽苍苔屐齿稀。\n白眼科头容觅伴，阮家粗饭莫相违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"向王子龙乞盆兰","author":"郭之奇","text":"九畹丛中百种芳，较书台下日相望。\n庭兰索伍情多迫，莫使琴歌对草伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月三十夜与承之偕二兄小酌计春已去十有三日议各取平上去入之十三韵为五绝以纪事上平十三","author":"郭之奇","text":"六载风光不系跟，逢春能几见家园。\n相怜何事轻相失，花木凄然亦与喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下平十三","author":"郭之奇","text":"多时春去月犹三，留得春名一刻甘。\n今夕何当重赋别，双愁强付一杯担。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上十三","author":"郭之奇","text":"眼见东风愁不反，朝来梅雨催春远。\n阶前落尽百端花，懒俟今宵苔卧稳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去十三","author":"郭之奇","text":"悠然相对莫相问，报答时光都有分。\n伊我九旬同醉醒，诸篇颇觉春遥近。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入十三","author":"郭之奇","text":"春情我意肯终极，每至离思同黯默。\n却怪疏怀百懒惛，无端幽事偏窥得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊小步承之向索诗题口占答之","author":"郭之奇","text":"参差一叶渡春溪，同步芳洲日正西。\n共道春山皆故识，更邀溪月作新题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过峡江悼自从叔二绝 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"当年江峡醉扁舟，击楫同歌万里流。\n三载家山人物变，不堪此地独回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过峡江悼自从叔二绝 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"云满长江雨满舟，悲予不但泪添流。\n死生既隔山河异，他日归看宿草头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答杨承之上巳诗","author":"郭之奇","text":"已过清明修褉天，桃花欲尽杏花颠。\n一声黄鸟催春色，满地红苔落雨溅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白发非春事承之亦愁春乎答此似嘲实以慰也","author":"郭之奇","text":"三月飞红乱欲纷，江头风色正愁君。\n独馀两岸杨花絮，留与扁舟丝鬓分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百里金陵","author":"郭之奇","text":"百里晴江二水新，六朝金色数峰春。\n烟花想像青门内，压酒吴姬是主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石吊李白墓四首 其一 一快其遇知章也","author":"郭之奇","text":"英豪相视一杯中，笑向金銮顾紫宫。\n貂作当年知己具，靴留千载侍臣风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石吊李白墓四首 其二 一伤其厄力士也","author":"郭之奇","text":"赋就调羹动主知，歌成酌酒感妃辞。\n无端宿醉双靴落，故令新妆一语疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石吊李白墓四首 其三 一伤其以诗见弃而快其才也","author":"郭之奇","text":"金笺捧出庆池章，落羽翻辞銮殿旁。\n供奉清班能几日，风骚不尽古今场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石吊李白墓四首 其四 一快其以酒相忘而伤其志也","author":"郭之奇","text":"主恩朋意两殊遭，知遇无缘答寸毫。\n只为宫阉多气色，故藏名姓入醇醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟间柳絮二首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"柳絮纷纷不耐春，先来羁缆向愁人。\n萍飘自合伊同绪，未落衣襟已怅神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35739,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟间柳絮二首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"本随春放亦春迷，恼乱东吹一片西。\n错认梅风飞粤岭，分明桃水落吴溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"既而见柳浪不兴丝波自卷觉起絮因风尚多事耳","author":"郭之奇","text":"未假风情向日飞，预分晴气散春菲。\n无端潮色随丝住，遮莫青流着素衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其一 西楚霸王妾虞氏","author":"郭之奇","text":"楚歌声尽落腥风，霜剑先君试粉红。\n拚得残魂随马右，大王留面渡江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其二 魏武赎归蔡文姬","author":"郭之奇","text":"但得生还恨亦欢，离颜羞向漠云看。\n若云胡地堪回首，青草应将汉冢瞒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35743,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其三 桃叶渡泛秦淮","author":"郭之奇","text":"兰枻花樽桃叶津，秦时流水晋时人。\n杯前明月今归我，柳下清歌别有春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35744,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其四 春尽以诘旦渡江是晚风雷骤发","author":"郭之奇","text":"二旬孤缆白门津，花暖烟深数夕晨。\n此日江风知客去，一声平卷六朝春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35745,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其五 陈见侯自燕得选回相遇浦口舟中","author":"郭之奇","text":"浦云初出日边襟，江口欣闻岭外音。\n率尔乡情无细问，乡情话及令愁深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35746,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其六 四月一日发浦口","author":"郭之奇","text":"梦忽醒时春去深，风烟驿路马蹄寻。\n征车带得江云湿，散与滁山一片阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35747,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其七 舟车","author":"郭之奇","text":"天涯昏旦八千身，落尽舟车九十春。\n极目东来云外黛，举头北阻日边尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35748,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见郭六脩侍御怜古诗八绝句步韵漫成其二 其八 策蹇","author":"郭之奇","text":"关岭轻云驴背生，燕天远日照鞭明。\n幸无车马骚安邑，恰有莺花送客程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35749,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昏尘","author":"郭之奇","text":"西郊落日正明霞，北面昏尘欲暗车。\n却恨芳茵堤柳外，不随马足蔽征沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35750,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大店借宿","author":"郭之奇","text":"青钱买得主人情，白酒权浇远客程。\n野鸟檐茅同雾宿，邻鸡庭树又烟惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35751,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄河道中","author":"郭之奇","text":"群峰沓嶂逐河生，马首轻云到水明。\n西望昆源襟右入，天风吹出暮涛声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35752,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拖泥郊野宿","author":"郭之奇","text":"日落山深暂隐霞，西林倒挂月弦斜。\n灭明村火驱前导，代拂征鞍是主家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻姚永言不果北上","author":"郭之奇","text":"东车西马路横差，不见征人祇暗沙。\n眼里尘颜多错认，堤前柳色又迷花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望尘","author":"郭之奇","text":"倚日初能紫陌驰，因风转欲碧空吹。\n分明入眼惊相向，身近其中却不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35755,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汶上晓发见烟树参云","author":"郭之奇","text":"千林蓊郁碧云间，万鸟衔烟自往还。\n俯视氛埃不可犯，直临