01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓所有绿柳垂阴拂云檐落因复以此转招今础步其二之韵","author":"郭之奇","text":"白云绿树抱幽居，人境何年乍结庐。\n樽酒迟君茵席上，披襟共话柳风初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35781,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"州刺史唐伯闇以蕲州志相贻","author":"郭之奇","text":"问俗蕲春见楚书，水山奇异尽堪除。\n独留麟凤供金节，不教龟蛇乱里闾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35782,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧起","author":"郭之奇","text":"朝对梧风暮柳云，萧然一署自氤氲。\n北窗卧起中庭坐，木落天空雁几群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35783,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜吟","author":"郭之奇","text":"朝朝酬对一游艰，独剩孤吟入夜閒。\n梦落丹枫秋欲半，歌怀赤壁月初还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35784,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲秋三日送节马上口占别今础四首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"六节翩翩指北翔，臣谊翻令友情长。\n星分楚野迷千岫，思入燕天共一方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35785,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲秋三日送节马上口占别今础四首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"蹇蹇王臣各未家，客中离异倍伤嗟。\n秋深古道非前色，愁见堤荷作旧花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35786,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b9