汀舟喜见家乡在即三首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"西来汀水欲朝东，万嶂千岩一缕通。\n急濑掀刀难坐望，轻帷短被卧秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35793,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舍陆就汀舟喜见家乡在即三首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"青山频过不知名，但忆乡关此地迎。\n昨夜归魂先识路，秋风吹向绿榕城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35794,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至大埔闻乡音","author":"郭之奇","text":"八千里外始乡关，乍听乡音慰客颜。\n几夜梦依双膝下，征衣频拂念途艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35795,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]